[250.774691, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[250.774959, "o", "+    ``units`` is the string from the station register.  Accepted values are case‑insensitive and may be\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[250.774981, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
