[269.852018, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[269.852032, "o", "> "]
[269.852291, "o", "+    The FAO‑56 adjustment (Eq. 47) is used. If ``height_m`` is already 2 m the factor is 1.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[269.85231, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[269.852325, "o", "> "]
